{"title":"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Linear_Polynomials)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Linear Polynomials)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Quadratic_Polynomials)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Quadratic Polynomials)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Similar_to_Solution_2)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Similar to Solution 2)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Brute_Force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Brute Force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Mathematical_Dexterity)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Mathematical Dexterity)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Quadratic polynomials <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> have leading coefficients <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/f/8afe6a98f0632a1d5ffbadbcb97205578e7a3dd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"15\" /> respectively. The graphs of both polynomials pass through the two points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb51011e48a783a40e23d6e1a0a4b2f9a9b8ec73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(16,54)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/1/d9194f5a744476ee9eb8b7349a4aa37ad56d982d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(20,53).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" /> Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adbb2cfc6d430736112efd0c138450fe574a0d52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(0) + Q(0).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Linear_Polynomials.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Linear_Polynomials)\">Solution 1 (Linear Polynomials)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Linear Polynomials)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/0/7d08a6fd8a39aa04a265b78b446dfd12cb4453f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(x)=P(x)+Q(x).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"169\" height=\"20\" /> Since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />-terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> cancel, we conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3eeefa367883375994fd2e1f575d088bce9d8b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" /> is a linear polynomial.\n</p><p>Note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/c/6dc0b12d4c3c31646a4ab30f28d643f03dea5faf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{alignat*}{8} R(16) &amp;= P(16)+Q(16) &amp;&amp;= 54+54 &amp;&amp;= 108, \\\\ R(20) &amp;= P(20)+Q(20) &amp;&amp;= 53+53 &amp;&amp;= 106, \\end{alignat*}\" width=\"323\" height=\"43\" />\nso the slope of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3eeefa367883375994fd2e1f575d088bce9d8b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/a/37a2b89ecc458d2b2f662abc0c1692dd81c45084.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{106-108}{20-16}=-\\frac12.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"139\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>It follows that the equation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3eeefa367883375994fd2e1f575d088bce9d8b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/d/6adcbdd8b7cc19f0781d3730753fb4997be8eee9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[R(x)=-\\frac12x+c\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"37\" /> for some constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/1/421dbe5ac249bea2c9d25145a7eb9b73644c5c61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" /> and we wish to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/9/e4953c1cceeb9e9903d985bb3868cf88dcb0c7a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(0)=c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf1342f460285dfd226094ac3973558576c9982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=20$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> into this equation to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/0/9c018e6ae90595ef219a62497f3e5ec51b78dd3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$106=-\\frac12\\cdot20+c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"147\" height=\"38\" /> from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/b/dcb368fea40075b5ea1f1f5371af479cc2ac3e66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\boxed{116}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"78\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Quadratic_Polynomials.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Quadratic_Polynomials)\">Solution 2 (Quadratic Polynomials)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Quadratic Polynomials)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1d1740b4373f7b7edd9b7012f17fdbe02cdf339.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{alignat*}{8} P(x) &amp;= &amp;2x^2 + ax + b, \\\\ Q(x) &amp;= &amp;\\hspace{1mm}-2x^2 + cx + d, \\end{alignat*}\" width=\"179\" height=\"47\" />\nfor some constants <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/c/7fc20cbb9094799e89db1f2762f5f073abe9d1bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p>We are given that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b3ea589e77e0001a58cebc6428ae3638d908f07.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{alignat*}{8} P(16) &amp;= &amp;512 + 16a + b &amp;= 54, \\hspace{20mm}&amp;&amp;(1) \\\\ Q(16) &amp;= &amp;\\hspace{1mm}-512 + 16c + d &amp;= 54, &amp;&amp;(2) \\\\ P(20) &amp;= &amp;800 + 20a + b &amp;= 53,  &amp;&amp;(3) \\\\ Q(20) &amp;= &amp;\\hspace{1mm}-800 + 20c + d &amp;= 53, &amp;&amp;(4) \\end{alignat*}\" width=\"355\" height=\"93\" />\nand we wish to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/7/aa7a88d8d3416f9e6ad2745cabef8d3a992d64d2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P(0)+Q(0)=b+d.\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"18\" />\nWe need to cancel <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/1/201a2eef545643b50b07fed5c09e894bcced5c58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c.$\" width=\"11\" height=\"8\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a0ca9d17e14d0adc45c32a65186b429a037e9f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{lcm}(16,20)=80,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" /> we subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/2/542accac0ef0176c10be1a9dde3767a34ee23b2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cdot[(3)+(4)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/b/27b5219f416150c967e6905377d37c2d1874ba20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\cdot[(1)+(2)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/9/a4905e8f155a93ecc45101b300bb24601f7be0f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b+d=5\\cdot(54+54)-4\\cdot(53+53)=\\boxed{116}.\\]\" width=\"341\" height=\"23\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Similar_to_Solution_2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Similar_to_Solution_2)\">Solution 3 (Similar to Solution 2)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Similar to Solution 2)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like Solution 2, we can begin by setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> to the quadratic above, giving us\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b3ea589e77e0001a58cebc6428ae3638d908f07.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{alignat*}{8} P(16) &amp;= &amp;512 + 16a + b &amp;= 54, \\hspace{20mm}&amp;&amp;(1) \\\\ Q(16) &amp;= &amp;\\hspace{1mm}-512 + 16c + d &amp;= 54, &amp;&amp;(2) \\\\ P(20) &amp;= &amp;800 + 20a + b &amp;= 53,  &amp;&amp;(3) \\\\ Q(20) &amp;= &amp;\\hspace{1mm}-800 + 20c + d &amp;= 53, &amp;&amp;(4) \\end{alignat*}\" width=\"355\" height=\"93\" />\nWe can first add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> to obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/6936bba3af91b17f2ebbe74fd8e8005c9ee9fef3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16(a-c) + (b+d) = 108.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"206\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p>Next, we can add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88ea3916e8089c7edbccc3ff91e58e01a6e2682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/104992efa4deaa9a2dfeeec9b331ad0bf628f80a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"20\" /> to obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/0/4400310b2c2bb9949e5921f6821f73d9b5d8c542.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20(a-c) + (b+d) = 106.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"206\" height=\"20\" /> By subtracting these two equations, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/1/2712aa17e95d1fd867bd81ffe8a39dfe1d5a5fc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(a-c) = -2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" /> so substituting this into equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/c/d0cdf064d17ed2120aa99a830fc2cf2a43492f2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[(1) + (2)],$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" /> we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/0/e70ca4ca936395cc0bc5e764651f7c86d4411381.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\cdot (-2) + (b+d) = 108,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"194\" height=\"20\" /> so therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2efb8133cd2da628d9ea14d6ac11574fe7989b29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+d = \\boxed{116}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"109\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~jessiewang28\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Brute_Force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Brute_Force)\">Solution 4 (Brute Force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Brute Force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1d1740b4373f7b7edd9b7012f17fdbe02cdf339.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{alignat*}{8} P(x) &amp;= &amp;2x^2 + ax + b, \\\\ Q(x) &amp;= &amp;\\hspace{1mm}-2x^2 + cx + d, \\end{alignat*}\" width=\"179\" height=\"47\" />\nBy substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/d/f6d3b8c1fd33542bf5122c8451a52a9bc05ea099.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(16, 54)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/4/7946509a649dd8878d0f8669f52af6ee6b894efd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(20, 53)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" /> into these equations, we can get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/e/f3e64d17d54dd7230c9b40a9021a3839718fe063.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 2(16)^2 + 16a + b &amp;= 54, \\\\ 2(20)^2 + 20a + b &amp;= 53. \\end{align*}\" width=\"174\" height=\"47\" />\nHence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/2/6820f98804da0c012a5ac1791427700afa7e4333.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -72.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/1/931c4b8c11c115c68024c0b49c58ab726a5f25e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 698.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Similarly,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f4a353889a1b59d9bb430b7684bb8d7b0836d82.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} -2(16)^2 + 16c + d &amp;= 54, \\\\ -2(20)^2 + 20c + d &amp;= 53. \\end{align*}\" width=\"188\" height=\"47\" />\nHence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e34caab6958efddd34c98382366e37cf73bb401.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 71.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c1b7de0e95f45fe8465eb15244c0ecd53567834.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = -582.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/e/b5eb26fe2f20d5ead4e795480229c35a6af81d6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = P(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/012098b15c71af6b2f09a7881070a135cdcac01a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = Q(0).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />\nTherefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/5/8154567bf59b4b71090995f4f2cfeea8a39550d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P(0) + Q(0) = 698 + (-582) = \\boxed{116}.\\]\" width=\"292\" height=\"23\" />\n~Littlemouse\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Add the equations of the polynomials <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/3/4438dcf3d574ac770276f6e585de5652eee7b371.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2x^2+ax+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/b/f5babba625bb00cfcaee472bc1a6690bd05041f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-2x^2+cx+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/c/f1c1d3364198323686976ff92ec0147016537f6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y=(a+c)x+(b+d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"185\" height=\"20\" />. This equation must also pass through the two points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb51011e48a783a40e23d6e1a0a4b2f9a9b8ec73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(16,54)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/d/73d49527c37a1f8d8a2da6bbfd14a334514254f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(20,53)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/d/59d34b53ee261d7e8737e6c8452d7b8a7c5c518e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=a+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/4/d640566e47e3c006dcd053461872b440ce1f2269.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=b+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" />. We then have two equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/6/4662ec70be598a086536f9e37014984fe037a06e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 108&amp;=16m+n, \\\\ 106&amp;=20m+n. \\end{align*}\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />\nWe are trying to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/5676b37d8f4c0b25307d72adffc5d065dbc7c9fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=P(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />. Using elimination:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1fcd49b9925b8be1b1ede8f55534573751c913a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 540&amp;=80m+5n, \\\\ 424&amp;=80m+4n. \\end{align*}\" width=\"131\" height=\"39\" />\nSubtracting both equations, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/f/cff314245492c6a8c30fe1ebbf949d06c089318c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=\\boxed{116}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"76\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~eevee9406\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Mathematical_Dexterity.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Mathematical_Dexterity)\">Video Solution (Mathematical Dexterity)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Mathematical Dexterity)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sUfbEBCQ6RY\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sUfbEBCQ6RY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/MJ_M-xvwHLk?t=7\">https://youtu.be/MJ_M-xvwHLk?t=7</a>\n</p><p>~ThePuzzlr\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/eDZUzvwt4SE\">https://youtu.be/eDZUzvwt4SE</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/D3sSHlZQIlE\">https://youtu.be/D3sSHlZQIlE</a>\n</p><p>~AMC &amp; AIME Training\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I\" title=\"2022 AIME I\">2022 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2022\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2022 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Sol